  "dct_description_sm": [
    "<span style='color:rgb(50, 49, 48); font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe WP&quot;, Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:14px;'>Frog Living City Report Card grading.<br /></span><div><span style='color:rgb(50, 49, 48); font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe WP&quot;, Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:14px;'>Frog/toad site scores were calculated by taking the sum of the scores for each unique species per site per year. If a site contained more than one survey station an average was taken. Final site scores were used for grading. Averages were calculated for each 5 year period and compared.</span></div><div><span style='color:rgb(50, 49, 48); font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe WP&quot;, Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:14px;'>Data is for period ending: 12/31/2019</span></div><div><span style='color:rgb(50, 49, 48); font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Segoe WP&quot;, Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:14px;'><br /></span></div><div><span style='font-family:&quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px;'>View the </span><a href='https://storymaps.arcgis.com/stories/72fec6db9b894e8d8a50eb97c320f666' rel='nofollow ugc' style='color:rgb(0, 121, 193); text-decoration-line:none; font-family:&quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px;' target='_blank'>Natural Heritage System Reporting Key</a><span style='font-family:&quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:16px;'> for detailed information about target setting and evaluation of current conditions and trends, including data collection and analysis methodologies.</span></div>"
